30763481.025900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"275650d9-756f-4fbf-b1b0-184b451c76fb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"たしかに集合の演算にすればいいのか。","ts":"1630763182.024800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=gKe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6eaae269-56c2-44b9-9a2d-bbbb374d3a01","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"setがプリミティブなのいいな","ts":"1630763178.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGmIB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42f703ad-89cb-451c-ae3d-49fe94d267fe","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"おー。すごい。なるほど。","ts":"1630763163.024300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IEmhm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bac8ea1-b47a-44f2-909b-5ad948428a1c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これでWAになったので、コンテスト中はむかついてこれで通しました。。\n```s = [input(), input(), input()]\n \nlst = {\n    \"ABC\": 0,\n    \"ARC\": 0,\n    \"AGC\": 0,\n    \"AHC\": 0,\n}\n \nfor elm in s:\n    lst[elm] = 1\n \nfor k, v in lst.items():\n    if v == 0:\n        print(k)\n        break```","ts":"1630763155.024100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9OX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70d12283-8121-4934-affc-bd7dd7815eee","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"別解求められてないですけど、私なら\n```{\"ABC\", \"ARC\", \"AGC\", \"AHC\"} - {S1, S2, S3}```\nかな","ts":"1630763133.023900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Trh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6371c50-f4fb-41b8-968e-9ab6d462d6a0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"です","ts":"1630763098.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AaPoC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9586395-c76e-41b5-9eeb-3dba6f8ea0bb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。。sorted_s[3]はアクセスしちゃだめなんですね。","ts":"1630763094.023200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i/y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"935f5d41-7ee9-44b9-9f3b-d4b54b9cba01","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"IndexError起きてそう","ts":"1630763051.022700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nls"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c22b068-59c2-4428-a4e1-24d8fecc7406","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これ \u003chttps://atcoder.jp/contests/abc217/tasks/abc217_b\u003e の答えとしてこれ \u003chttps://atcoder.jp/contests/abc217/submissions/25566888\u003e を提出したのですが、2件のテストケースで実行時エラーになってしまいました。どうしてでしょうか。。？\n```    s1 = input()\n    s2 = input()\n    s3 = input()\n     \n    lst = [\"ABC\", \"ARC\", \"AGC\", \"AHC\"]\n     \n    sorted_lst = sorted(lst)\n    sorted_s = sorted([s1, s2, s3])\n     \n    def solve():\n        if sorted_lst[0] != sorted_s[0]:\n            return sorted_lst[0]\n        elif sorted_lst[1] != sorted_s[1]:\n            return sorted_lst[1]\n        elif sorted_lst[2] != sorted_s[2]:\n            return sorted_lst[2]\n        elif sorted_lst[3] != sorted_s[3]:\n            return sorted_lst[3]\n     \n    print(solve())```","ts":"1630762926.021800","attachments":[{"fallback":"AtCoder: B - AtCoder Quiz","id":1,"title":"B - AtCoder Quiz","title_link":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc217/tasks/abc217_b","text":"AtCoder is a programming contest site for anyone from beginners to experts. We hold weekly programming contests online.","thumb_url":"https://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"AtCoder","service_icon":"http://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","thumb_width":280,